  "prefLabel": "Occ 405.02 Referral Not Required",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Occ 405.02 Referral Not Required. Occupational therapy services can be provided without a referral, subject to regulatory and payer requirements pursuant to RSA 326-C:2. A referral shall not be required for a licensed occupational therapist to provide:\n\n(a) Consultation;\n\n(b) Screening, evaluation, and re-evaluation of clients;\n\n(c) Wellness services;\n\n(d) Prevention services; and\n\n(e) Special education related occupational therapy services.\n\nSource. #8896, eff 6-7-07; ss by #10902, eff 7-29-15; renumbered by #13417 (formerly Occ 408.02); ss by #14478, eff 3-13-26, EXPIRES: 3-13-36 (formerly Occ 407.02)",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/occ100-500.html"
